<title>JAPAN: Tsuchiya Home plans share split.</title>
<headline>Tsuchiya Home plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tsuchiya Home Co Ltd said</p>
<p>on Monday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on December 20,</p>
<p>for shareholders as of October 31.</p>
</text>
